html">The religious leader warned that deforestation, illegal mining and pollution threaten the Amazon and its inhabitants. In Peru, the pope also demanded justice for Indigenous leaders killed defending their ancestral lands.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Despite restrictive abortion laws, Poland's 'Abortomat' — a locker that dispenses abortion pills — helps women who want to end a pregnancy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3522b983202a91710c057024bb40ff8bdc3930b2b48d00d99c7f82fd606e93fe</id><updated>2026-11-16T06:49:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-15T14:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/polish-activists-face-opposition-as-they-make-abortion-more-accessible/a-79943914--39db4083c558.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/despite-restrictive-abortion-laws-poland-s-abortomat-a-locker-that-dispenses-abortion-pills-helps-women-who-want-to-end-a-pregnancy/a-79943914?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Abortion laws in Poland are very restrictive. Activists there have found a new way to help women wanting to terminate a pregnancy: the "Abortomat," a locker that dispenses abortion pills. But they face fierce opposition.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>ASEAN offers Myanmar's sidelined leaders a path back to summits, but says restrictions will stay until there is meaningful progress on its peace plan</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eea1da43e56b2a9597cb57af5fda0d94f483457362e4b5f5fd6771b563461ad0</id><updated>2026-11-16T06:49:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-15T12:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/asean-offers-myanmar-s-sidelined-leaders-a-path-back-to-summits-but-says-restrictions-will-stay-unti/a-79951878--8a50f9fda2bd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/asean-offers-myanmar-s-sidelined-leaders-a-path-back-to-summits-but-says-restrictions-will-stay-until-there-is-meaningful-progress-on-its-peace-plan/a-79951878?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Southeast Asian leaders have agreed to engage Myanmar in stages after years of excluding its leaders from high-level meetings. The bloc says Myanmar could regain full representation if it makes progress on a peace plan.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Macron urges unity as Francophonie summit opens in Cambodia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1f0e94504940f216110a2d3a808bf22f4d4d0256f637c162e19717f034d3675c</id><updated>2026-11-16T06:49:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-15T08:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/macron-urges-unity-as-francophonie-summit-opens-in-cambodia/a-79951201--02576530ba13.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/macron-urges-unity-as-francophonie-summit-opens-in-cambodia/a-79951201?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Leaders of French-speaking nations gathered in Phnom Penh as a row over who should lead the Francophonie and Congo’s threat to quit put pressure on Macron to broker consensus.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Germany holds national day of remembrance</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:63a1a1fd57a847889b3c6680d5b668768d8850e70a26d4ac988e216a90eec1ab</id><updated>2026-11-16T06:49:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-15T07:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-germany-holds-national-day-of-remembrance/live-79947500--7252f2ee958f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-germany-holds-national-day-of-remembrance/live-79947500?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Events were held for "Volkstrauertag," a day commemorating victims of war and oppression. Meanwhile, experts said the country is headed for a budget crisis.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How AI is likely to change Germany's 